# FW5 names simblk.py can't find: the interrupt source's synchronizers,
# two stages per request flag on the PicoBlaze clock (FW4 has five flags on
# the 2x clock, FW5 adds the five MBC3 clock-write flags), and the command
# bits they load, which the PicoBlaze reads at B5 and B8; and the I2C
# pads' tristate enable (OUTPUT EC)
